[101.395613, "o", "\u001b[29A\u001b[1G\u001b[K1. \u001b[1mTokenizer\u001b[22m - Converts input strings into tokens:\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K  \u25e6 NUMBER, DICE_OP ('d'), KEEP_HIGH ('kh'), PLUS, MINUS, STAR, LPAREN, RPAREN, EOF\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K  \u25e6 Handles whitespace and multi-character operators\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K2. \u001b[1mRecursive-Descent Parser\u001b[22m - Builds an explicit AST using grammar:\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K  \u25e6 expr := term ((PLUS | MINUS) term)*\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K  \u25e6 term := factor (STAR factor)*\r\r\n\u001b[5G\u001b[Kfactor := dice_expr | NUMBER | LPAREN expr RPAREN\r\r\n\u001b[5G\u001b[Kdice_expr := NUMBER DICE_OP NUMBER (KEEP_HIGH NUMBER)?\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K3. \u001b[1mAST Node Types\u001b[22m:\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K  \u25e6 NumberNode - Integer literals\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K  \u25e6 DiceNode - Dice rolls (NdS) with optional keep-highest modifier\r\r\n\u001b[5G\u001b[KBinaryOpNode - Binary operations (+, -, *)\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K4. \u001b[1mTree-Walking Evaluator\u001b[22m - Recursively evaluates the AST:\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K  \u25e6 Uses seeded random (seed=42) for reproducible dice rolls\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K  \u25e6 roll_dice() actually rolls N dice with S sides and applies keep-highest\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[1m\u001b[3mResults\u001b[23m\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[E\u001b[1G\u001b[K| Expression | AST | Result |\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;239m\u001b[2m \u001b[22m\u001b[38;5;75m\u2191 70 above \u00b7 \u2193 1 below \u00b7 Shift+\u2191\u2193 \u00b7 End \u2913\u001b[38;5;239m\u001b[2m \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500 \u001b[22m\u001b[38;5;35mCreate a Python file dice_eva\u2026\u001b[38;5;239m\u001b[2m \u2500\u2500\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[E\u001b[E\u001b[E\u001b[E\u001b[E\u001b[E\u001b7\u001b[2;77H\u001b[38;5;210m\u2584\